Spider morphological character data
Collected by Mimangsa Darshan Chakraborty (Mizoram University)

This dataset (all files under data/, including the workbooks in data/raw/ and the
derived files data/processed/spiders.csv and data/data_dictionary.csv) is licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

You are free to share and adapt the data for any purpose, including commercially,
provided you give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and indicate
if changes were made.

